# fontyar
===
 Fontyar brings every typeface on your system into one fast, beautiful workspace. Whether you're a designer hunting for the perfect weight, a developer wiring up web fonts, or a Persian typographer juggling hundreds of local fonts, fontyar gives you a single place to see, test, and ship them.
